        <p><url href="https://openstax.org/books/college-algebra-2e/pages/4-3-fitting-linear-models-to-data">Fitting Linear Models to Data (4.3)</url></p>
        <p><url href="https://openstax.org/books/college-algebra-2e/pages/6-7-exponential-and-logarithmic-models">Exponential and Logarithmic Models (6.7)</url></p>-->
    </subsection>
</section>